 "key_insight": "Staffie Owners wins breed-plus-town searches with a breed-only marketplace: a hub per town, county and region, filter pages by colour, price and KC registration, and live average-price data by town and colour, each hub closing on the same four-question FAQ. It cannot vouch for any seller, and its listings mix crosses, rehomes and even a wanted ad beside KC litters, so BSUK can beat it with one breeder's verified blue Staffy litters, named health tests and a transparent price page, on city pages that answer the same questions with first-hand detail."
